          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "ParameterizedTest"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ", and others as meta-annotations, you can also create custom composed annotations at the test method level. For example, if we wish to create a composed annotation that combines the "
